WEBVTT

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.120
so does Sugi's,

00:09:01.161 --> 00:09:04.582
and hundreds of women's
and girls' like them.

00:09:05.499 --> 00:09:09.420
Their stories would not
have been seen or heard

00:09:09.461 --> 00:09:12.464
if people like me didn't show them.

00:09:13.507 --> 00:09:15.884
We need to start valuing them.

00:09:17.469 --> 00:09:21.181
The first step to any change

00:09:21.223 --> 00:09:24.101
is acknowledgment and awareness.

00:09:25.311 --> 00:09:28.522
Otherwise, this cycle of harm
will continue.